$MDESC::Type = "Star Wars";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Capture the Flag" @
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
         "\n\n<f1>Location:<f0> The Galactic Empire and the Rebel Alliance battle each other at Mos Eisley, a spaceport on the desert planet of Tatooine." @
         "\n\n<f1>Jedi Archives: " @
         "\n\n<f0>Mos Eisley. Located in a broad valley in the Great Mesra Plateau, north of Anchorhead and southeast of the Jundland Wastes." @
         "\n\n<f0>Local attractions." @
         "\n\n<f0>Chalmun's Spaceport Cantina. Water distribution plant. Community junk yard. " @
         "\n\n<f2>You will never find a more wretched hive of scum and villainy. We must be cautious.";